Accordingly, we answer point No.1 in the affirmative.
For the aforesaid reasons and discussions, we proceed to pass the following:
ORDER 1. MFA No.102573 of 219 filed by respondent No.1- Rajashree Mallappa Rajagolkar, is allowed in part.
IA.I of 2021 filed under Order XLI Rule 27 read with section 151 of Code of Civil Procedure is allowed;
2. Judgment and Award dated 04th August, 2018 passed in MVC No.1948 of 2015 by the X Additional District Judge and Member of Additional Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Belagavi and the order dated 05th April, 2019 passed in Civil Revision Petition No.8 of 2018 by the X Additional District and Sessions Judge, Belagavi are set aside;
3.
The matter is remitted to the Tribunal with a direction to provide an opportunity to respondent No.1 to produce additional documents as shown in the list and also to adduce oral evidence;
