9 4.
The claimant is also permitted to adduce any evidence on his behalf;
5.
Since this court has set aside the judgment and award dated 04th August, 2018 passed in MVC No.1948 of 2015 by the X Additional District Judge and Member of Additional Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Belagavi, Miscellaneous First Appeal No.103437 of 2018 preferred by the claimant seeking enhancement of compensation does not survive for consideration and accordingly, the same is disposed of;
6.
Both the parties are directed to appear before the Tribunal on 04th July, 2024 without seeking any further notice in this regard;
7.
The Tribunal is requested to dispose of the case as expeditiously as possible, and in any event not later than four months from the date of appearance of parties;
